{"2840690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The One", "steam_appid": 2840690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The One – A post-apocalyptic survival game created by two independent developers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has fallen into chaos. Society has collapsed, and the undead roam freely. In The One, your mission is simple: survive. Gather resources, build shelter, fight off zombies, and interact with other survivors  open world. Are you ready to face the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ KEY FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Survive in a Hostile World – Scavenge for food, water, and essential supplies, or cultivate your own resources to endure the harsh post-apocalyptic environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/9a8ffe21abeb73dc411bef8f4da087c6.poster.avif?t=1788285777\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/9a8ffe21abeb73dc411bef8f4da087c6.webm?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/9a8ffe21abeb73dc411bef8f4da087c6.mp4?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Engage in Intense Combat – Battle of zombies, dangerous wildlife, and rival survivors using a variety of weapons. Every fight is a test of skill and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >         <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/89525bd6e2a2a1c18678423c98158a78.poster.avif?t=1788285777\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/89525bd6e2a2a1c18678423c98158a78.webm?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/89525bd6e2a2a1c18678423c98158a78.mp4?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Explore a Vast Open World – Search abandoned buildings, forests, and ruins for valuable materials and hidden secrets. Every corner of the world holds opportunities – and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/a2eaf1bc14d5518329c5fa48ec7cf571.poster.avif?t=1788285777\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/a2eaf1bc14d5518329c5fa48ec7cf571.webm?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/a2eaf1bc14d5518329c5fa48ec7cf571.mp4?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Gather and Craft – Chop down trees, mine raw materials, and craft essential tools, weapons, and equipment that will increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/44c4d21cb5064ff5d7672d1fdf871a5f.poster.avif?t=1788285777\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/44c4d21cb5064ff5d7672d1fdf871a5f.webm?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/44c4d21cb5064ff5d7672d1fdf871a5f.mp4?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Build and Fortify Your Shelter – Construct and upgrade your base to withstand zombie attacks and provide a safe haven for yourself and your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/8543eeacda0aeb97c6f59c7bcf770453.poster.avif?t=1788285777\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/8543eeacda0aeb97c6f59c7bcf770453.webm?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/8543eeacda0aeb97c6f59c7bcf770453.mp4?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Weapon Customization – Modify and upgrade your weapons to maximize their effectiveness in combat. A well-prepared survivor is a living survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/49acd01ceb7d194466fc28e279f3ce3f.poster.avif?t=1788285777\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/49acd01ceb7d194466fc28e279f3ce3f.webm?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/49acd01ceb7d194466fc28e279f3ce3f.mp4?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Dynamic Missions and Rewards – Take on challenging tasks to earn valuable resources, blueprints, and rewards that will aid your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/ee7ff60fb3f400dec96053acc3f7e9e3.poster.avif?t=1788285777\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/ee7ff60fb3f400dec96053acc3f7e9e3.webm?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/ee7ff60fb3f400dec96053acc3f7e9e3.mp4?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Trade and Cooperate – Interact with other survivors to trade goods, form alliances, or face off against hostile factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/9c6328ad6970188607d112d68ed6bdf3.poster.avif?t=1788285777\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/9c6328ad6970188607d112d68ed6bdf3.webm?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840690/extras/9c6328ad6970188607d112d68ed6bdf3.mp4?t=1788285777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 EARLY ACCESS – JOIN THE JOURNEY! The One is an evolving experience, and we need your feedback! Join us in Early Access and help shape the game’s future with your ideas and support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apocalypse is here. Will you conquer it, or will you become another lost soul in the wasteland?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔗 Add to your wishlist now and prepare for the fight of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The One – A post-apocalyptic survival game created